{"version":1,"content":"<p>警方破獲一個位於將軍澳住宅單位的詐騙電話中心，檢獲「貓池」通訊設備等證物，以涉嫌詐騙拘捕一名24歲本地男子。</p><p>初步相信電騙中心運作約一星期，至少涉及一宗損失約10萬元的騙案。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T08:38:12.926356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T06:45:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:57:40.035547+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"f86e1264e84357e65327069db57f7940b60d5ef9963f2ec6c32b58267d343ad3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}